{"title": "沙发上的哲学家", "index": 9, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\">\n<p class=\"calibre_9\" id=\"filepos65498\"><span class=\"calibre1\">第三章</span></p><blockquote class=\"calibre_17\"><blockquote class=\"calibre_18\">事情总会无可避免地朝坏处发展。</blockquote></blockquote><div class=\"mbp_pagebreak\" id=\"calibre_pb_8\"></div>\n</body>"}]}